#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:1
msgid "Shanghai University of Political Science and Law"
msgstr "上海政法学院"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:4
msgid "上海政法学院"
msgstr "上海政法学院"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:6
msgid "University | Qingpu | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "高校｜青浦区｜资料核查日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:8
msgid "Ministry of Education institution code: 4131011835."
msgstr "教育部学校标识码：4131011835。"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:10
msgid ""
"Institutional entry in the June 2026 Ministry of Education register. "
"Suggested collaboration themes: Legal technology, IP, governance. These "
"themes are editorial routing guidance, not a verified offer of laboratory "
"access or startup funding."
msgstr "该校列入教育部2026年6月公布的高校名录。可关注的合作方向包括：法律科技、知识产权、治理。这些方向仅供寻找合作方时参考，不代表已确认可使用相关实验室或获得创业资助。"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Evidence S086 "
"<https://www.moe.gov.cn/jyb_xxgk/s5743/s5744/202606/t20260618_1441074.html>`_. "
"全国高等学校名单 - 中华人民共和国教育部政府门户网站."
msgstr "`资料来源 S086 <https://www.moe.gov.cn/jyb_xxgk/s5743/s5744/202606/t20260618_1441074.html>`_. 全国高等学校名单 - 中华人民共和国教育部政府门户网站."

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:14
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "项目状态与支持内容"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:17
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:19
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "尚未确认统一的现金资助额度、费用减免或股权比例，请向运营机构索取最新书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:21
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系方式与地址"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:24
msgid ""
"Official university website; request the technology-transfer, research "
"cooperation or entrepreneurship office"
msgstr "通过学校官网联系技术转移、科研合作或创业服务部门"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:26
msgid "`Official website / intake route <https://www.shupl.edu.cn/>`_"
msgstr "`官网及申请渠道 <https://www.shupl.edu.cn/>`_"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:28
msgid ""
"Use the official website to request the responsible team and current "
"application route. Email addresses are not reproduced in this publication."
msgstr "请通过官网咨询具体负责部门及最新申请方式。本图谱不公开电子邮箱地址。"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:30
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图采用行政区或校区参考点，不代表已核实的办公地址。"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:32
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:35
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "以下步骤为本书整理的申请参考，实际办理流程以最新官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:37
msgid ""
"Find the relevant research group and state the scientific or industrial "
"problem."
msgstr "寻找研究方向匹配的团队，明确科学问题或产业需求。"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:39
msgid ""
"Send a short proposal covering data, equipment, outputs, funding and "
"timescale."
msgstr "提交简要合作方案，说明数据、设备、预期成果、经费和进度。"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:41
msgid ""
"Agree the collaboration route, publication, IP and institutional "
"authorization."
msgstr "商定合作方式、成果发表、知识产权和单位授权。"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:43
msgid "Obtain written access or project approval before beginning the work."
msgstr "取得书面使用许可或项目批准后，再开展工作。"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:45
msgid ""
"Confirm whether external founders can apply, whether student or alumni "
"status is required, who owns the research IP, and whether support is a "
"service, a loan, a grant or equity. The thematic match in this profile is "
"editorial guidance."
msgstr "请确认校外创业者能否申请，是否要求在校生或校友身份，科研成果的知识产权归属，以及支持属于服务、贷款、补助还是股权投资。本页所列合作方向仅供参考。"

#: ../../entities/university-shupl.rst:47
msgid ":doc:`Qingpu district route </districts/qingpu>`"
msgstr ":doc:`青浦区合作指南 </districts/qingpu>`"

